--- design ---
- vit_transformer_layer (the v4 module from T0028) compiled with
  `#pragma HLS INLINE off` → ONE physical hardware instance.
- LAYER_LOOP iterates 12× (sequential, not unrolled). Each iteration:
    1. invoke the shared vit_transformer_layer with layer-L weights
    2. copy its output buffer back to the input buffer for layer L+1
- Weights for all 12 layers passed as external ap_memory ports (~20 MB total)
  — NOT stored in on-chip BRAM. The testbench supplies them.
- Ping-pong via buf_in / buf_out (256×384 INT8 each).

