*** DSP = 36 — IDENTICAL to a single vit_transformer_layer (T0028 v4 = 36). ***
This confirms the time-multiplex worked: 12 layers reuse ONE physical instance,
so resource cost ≈ one layer + thin control. Inlining 12 copies would have been
432 DSP / 864 URAM (URAM over the 463 limit). The #pragma HLS INLINE off on
vit_transformer_layer is what made this work.

